# NOTE: this file deliberately does NOT contain a bare "lib/" rule anywhere.
# The incident on the shared team repo happened because a Python-style
# ".gitignore" line meant for "build/lib/" was written as just "lib/" with
# no anchor, which silently matched (and ate) the Flutter lib/ source folder
# everywhere in that repo. Keep this file Flutter-only and every rule either
# anchored to a specific path or clearly scoped, so that mistake can't repeat
# here.
